msgstr "iz čega je procenjeno"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:488
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "which one"
msgstr "koja stavka"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:637
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An account's face in groups: username, picture and description. The code does not distinguish purposes such as business, private or club. Everything that happens in a group is signed by a profile, so %{count} of the %{total} foreign keys point at this table. A profile either belongs to one account or several accounts share it. The profile of an app's process belongs to none."
msgstr "Lice naloga u grupama: korisničko ime, slika i opis. Namene kao poslovni, privatni ili klupski kod ne razlikuje. Sve što se dešava u grupi potpisuje profil, pa na ovu tabelu pokazuje %{count} od %{total} spoljnih ključeva. Profil pripada jednom nalogu ili ga deli više naloga. Profil procesa aplikacije ne pripada nijednom."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1578
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An app's process signs with a profile of its own"
msgstr "Proces aplikacije potpisuje se sopstvenim profilom"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:583
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "App process"
msgstr "Proces aplikacije"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1580
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every <Value>value</Value> and every <Group>group</Group> but the root has a creator, so what an app's process does is signed by a <Profile>profile</Profile> of its own, which belongs to no <Account>account</Account>. It comes with the rule that gives a collection of the app a process, as an <AppProcess>app process</AppProcess> owned by the editor who saved that rule, and it joins the app's group with what `everyone` may do there. Nobody logs in as it or picks it, nobody mentions or invites it or opens a direct conversation with it, it is not counted among the members, and groups that inherit members do not take it in. Removing the rule makes the process inactive and takes it out of the group, and its values keep their author. It writes only in the app's group and in the sub-groups it made itself, as far as its permissions there go. In a sub-group it makes it is a plain member, and people are the admins: its owner, while the owner still edits the app, and whoever set the process going. It pushes to the people of a role only with the right to mention roles. In the app's group nobody removes or blocks it, as its rule takes it in and out; in the sub-groups it makes, people may."
msgstr "Svaka <Value>vrednost</Value> i svaka <Group>grupa</Group> osim korena ima autora, pa ono što radi proces aplikacije potpisuje njegov sopstveni <Profile>profil</Profile>, koji ne pripada nijednom <Account>nalogu</Account>. Nastaje sa pravilom koje kolekciji aplikacije daje proces, kao <AppProcess>proces aplikacije</AppProcess> čiji je vlasnik urednik koji je to pravilo sačuvao, i ulazi u grupu aplikacije sa onim što tamo sme `everyone`. Niko se ne prijavljuje kao on niti ga bira, niko ga ne pominje, ne poziva i ne otvara direktan razgovor sa njim, ne računa se među članove, a grupe koje nasleđuju članove ga ne preuzimaju. Kad se pravilo ukloni, proces postaje neaktivan i izlazi iz grupe, a njegove vrednosti zadržavaju autora. Piše samo u grupi aplikacije i u podgrupama koje je sam napravio, koliko mu tamo dozvole dopuštaju. U podgrupi koju napravi on je običan član, a admini su ljudi: njegov vlasnik, dok još uređuje aplikaciju, i onaj ko je pokrenuo proces. Push ljudima jedne uloge šalje samo uz pravo da pominje uloge. U grupi aplikacije niko ga ne uklanja i ne blokira, jer ga pravilo uvodi i izvodi; u podgrupama koje napravi ljudi to mogu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1010
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The collection is named as an app names its own."
msgstr "Kolekcija je imenovana kao što aplikacija imenuje svoje."

